From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 06:52:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tests: Expect the two responsive-iframe allow-origins
 failures of the base

Two `container=subdomain` variants of
css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/responsive-iframe-allow-origins.html fail
their subtest at this fork's base, with an upstream-only build and without any
patch of the stack touching the test or its expectations. Upstream tracked the
same failures as servo/servo#47268 and settled them two days after this base,
in the WPT sync f9b43a6f0b9 (30-08-2026), which renamed the variants from
`allowed=` to `allow=` and marked their subtests as failing. This fork's base
predates that sync, so it still has the old test files and the old
expectations, and every CI run reports the two as stable unexpected results.

The expectations here say for the old variant names what upstream says for the
new ones.

Fork note: drop at the next sync; the upstream expectations then apply.

Validation: `./mach test-wpt --release css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/responsive-iframe-allow-origins.html` (25 variants): all as expected; the two variants also fail with an upstream-only release build (f2cb0bebc77).
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; root-caused and written by the agent)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
---
 .../responsive-iframe-allow-origins.html.ini              | 8 +++++++-
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tests/wpt/meta/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/responsive-iframe-allow-origins.html.ini b/tests/wpt/meta/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/responsive-iframe-allow-origins.html.ini
index 8016af1012e..2b28961e43c 100644
--- a/tests/wpt/meta/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/responsive-iframe-allow-origins.html.ini
+++ b/tests/wpt/meta/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/responsive-iframe-allow-origins.html.ini
@@ -3,7 +3,13 @@
 [responsive-iframe-allow-origins.html?origin=same,allowed=none,expect=150]
 
 [responsive-iframe-allow-origins.html?container=subdomain,origin=cross,allowed=wildcard,expect=400]
-  expected: TIMEOUT
+  expected: [OK, TIMEOUT]
+  [Allowed origins check: container=subdomain, origin=cross, allowed=wildcard]
+    expected: [FAIL, TIMEOUT]
+
+[responsive-iframe-allow-origins.html?container=subdomain,origin=same,allowed=wildcard,expect=400]
+  [Allowed origins check: container=subdomain, origin=same, allowed=wildcard]
+    expected: FAIL
 
 [responsive-iframe-allow-origins.html?origin=cross,allowed=self,expect=150]
 
